<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-11-10T23:36:32.342Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:36:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta’s air force continues striking civilian targets, killing a pregnant woman in Mrauk-U, bombing a school in Sagaing and attacking a Christian Bible school in Karen State, while resistance forces have seized three military outposts near the Sagaing-Kachin border and captured a key command headquarters and eleven bases. Drone strikes have hit the Tada-U airbase, expanding the use of aerial tactics. Thailand has placed ten border provinces on alert as cross-border fighting spreads. The military is courting U.S. rare-earth investment to reduce dependence on China, while China seeks green stones from Myanmar. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/10/myanmar-summons-german-diplomat-following-controversial-facebook-video?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOeGRlYnlQbHM3T3hGeWNXdHpuWWNnejNxWmVnbE1UTE1QLXFTa1BKRW9UUTdZTTJiQkxPVXR4cldabHRzdW9GUl9MbjF3YmR6czB4MUhiVWd0WFJyNXBXdVZ5U2lJdkJVOHZTMWVBY3oxbUtId1UxdENLNUVPYW1iUE5ROEpITjN1SmEzcUhuQjNBbXNiRzFYc3AwMkVRRUNnVVRxSTNOOVVVUHl0V3pGNmFLYXIwOUZY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTFBQbGN1Nk9pbGJENnE1VW1iMjVuS0IzOXBTZ1dTQ0xWREJVWnhyM1NpWWlMbzFDT2pjZlRkSmxvYnNtdk9PRlN4TDM0dWgwTTFWMG1melR3YVVnTGxMenhHQkZiSTNoZ3BvOWl3UzNwcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Narinjara News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQZ3E4Q1E3akF1M01NSXRPUTJueHF3cTkyT1VOWlJUOHZOR1hPeFVuQkV2dVduQkV2VFA3bWJPUENWN1p2Wkcwb184YVhEYWFScnZkUUJudDZxMHVkeEhrMHc0VWFvcHhCN0h0LV85Z1k3ZTRPVkRaQ2ktVU42NHRYemg2cFNkTF9faVphS01UcWpuQnFhYm1YZmVsaWVpeUZnV0RTWXcyeTZSLTI4N0pBQjVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Centre for Information Resilience&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&qu